  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業機電系統設計實務",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL DESIGN OF INDUSTRIAL MECHATRONIC SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "【產業機電系統設計實務】課程以智慧製造與自動化應用為核心，結合 PBL教學模式，帶領學生從產業需求出發，理解工廠自動化流程與設備整合方法。課程內容涵蓋智慧製造概念、手工具工廠製程分析、產業機器人導入案例、PLC 邏輯控制、感測器與執行器應用、機器人程式設計等實務主題，並以控制器與機器人模擬器為主要工具進行操作練習。\n學生將在跨領域教師與業界專家的指導下，完成從流程規劃、元件選型、控制程式設計到虛實整合測試的完整自動化專案。課程安排實作導向，讓學生透過工廠參訪、專案討論、模擬操作與實體測試，深入理解產業現場運作並提升問題解決能力。此外，課程亦與企業合作，提供實習與成果展示機會，使學生能將所學應用於真實情境，培養面向職場的系統整合能力、團隊協作能力與創新實作能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The “Practical Design of Industrial Mechatronic Systems” focuses on smart manufacturing and automation through a problem based learning (PBL) approach, guiding students from industry needs to complete full automation projects. The curriculum covers smart manufacturing concepts, hand tool factory process analysis, industrial robot case studies, PLC logic control, sensor and actuator applications, and robot programming, using controllers and robot simulators for hands on practice. Under interdisciplinary faculty and industry expert mentorship, students perform process planning, component selection, control program development, and virtual real integration testing, supplemented by factory visits, project discussions, simulations, and physical testing. In collaboration with Enterprises, the course also offers internships and showcase opportunities, enabling students to apply their skills in real world settings and develop system integration, teamwork, and innovative implementation abilities.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "透過系統思維，學生可以把智慧製造的各個子模組（感測、控制、資料分析）串接起來，掌握整體流程，進而在課堂上能正確講解與應用自動化技術。",
      "describe_en": "Through systems thinking, students can connect the various sub‑modules of smart manufacturing (sensing, control, data analysis), grasp the overall process, and consequently deliver accurate explanations and applications of automation technology in the classroom."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "熟悉智慧製造與自動化流程的概念與應用",
      "describe_en": "Become familiar with the concepts and applications of smart manufacturing and automation processes."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "完成從需求分析、元件選型到控制程式設計的完整自動化專案",
      "describe_en": "Complete a full automation project that covers requirement analysis, component selection, and control program development."
    }
  ],
